},{"c":"GDDY 2020 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2020-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ray Winborne","x":"It’s now table stakes. gross margin came in at 66% in a quarter, a 40 basis point expansion year-over-year. we also delivered operating leverage as the June restructuring actions reduced costs and care while G&A continued to benefit from both scale and lower discretionary expenses.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2020 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2020-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ray Winborne","x":"Obviously we saw a nice improvement, a lot of that being driven off the back of the growth in our software products there, I’m still seeing headwinds and will until we laugh the restructuring actions we took in June.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2021 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ray Winborne","x":"Given the strong pacing of the business, we’re raising our guidance for full-year revenue to $3.75 billion, or 13% growth, and we're also raising the outlook for unlevered free cash flow to $955 million or 16% growth.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2021 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sterling Auty","x":"Ray, congratulations on finishing up your tenure at GoDaddy on such a high note, but I am wondering how happy Mark is with you raising guidance before you step-out the door?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2021 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Drew Glaeser","x":"So we've seen news reports that GoDaddy, well pass along the Verizon – Verisign price increase when it goes into effect in September.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2021 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"We had it in all along these things aren't unusual and as Aman mentioned, we've traditionally passed them on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2021 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Nicholas Jones","x":"And then the second question is, can you remind us how the Verisign kind of dotcom price increases will trickle through?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2021 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Nicholas Jones","x":"I think it's likely to become a bigger impact next year as it flows through dot coms I think people are expecting to take another price increase sometime next year?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2021 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2022-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"One item to note is that during Q4, we continued the consolidation of our Arizona offices, resulting in a closure of 1 office and a $15 million onetime charge in our restructuring and other line.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2022 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Aman Bhutani","x":"We also continue to test price increases for our highly competitive and feature-rich Websites plus Marketing product.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2022 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Trevor Young","x":"How much of an impact was FX on GM given that maybe a bit more of COGS there, such as like domain pass-through costs and infrastructure are incurred in dollars versus the revenue mix?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2022 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2022-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Aman Bhutani","x":"And you'll continue to see us do it where we continue to be nuanced in our approach on pricing looking to balance both what's happening sort of macro-economically or within a geo versus also our ability to take share and push in versus take price.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2022 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2022-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Unidentified Analyst","x":"And just on the -- Mark, you called out some areas that you've heard some things you've done to drive some cost savings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2022 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2023-02-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Aaron Kessler","x":"And does guidance include any maybe price increases, or just your general thoughts on ability to raise pricing in the future as well?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2022 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2023-02-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Deepak Mathivanan","x":"Can you talk about philosophy – your philosophy in 2023 whether you see potential to raise prices on any products either on the domain side or on other areas?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2022 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2023-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aman Bhutani","x":"As a result, we have taken some aggressive and disciplined actions in our cost structure that will result in over $100 million in annualized cost savings, preserving our ability to achieve profitability targets even in a weak economic environment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2022 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2023-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"On restructuring, we took certain actions necessary to align our structure with the current economic environment and position ourselves for future growth.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2023-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"Core Platform revenue was supported by a 5% growth in domains from a combination of new customer adds, attach and price increases on renewals.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2023-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"…existing customers to our payments platform in the US.; lastly, we are on target to complete our restructuring action in the second quarter, driving better operating leverage in our core platform segment and improving our overall operating margin in the second half of the year. With that,…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2023-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"We expect to continue to drive operating leverage through strong execution and our restructuring efforts.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2023-05-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Ygal Arounian","x":"But certainly recently but really over the past couple of months there's been a greater dialogue about generative AI disrupting the web builder business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2023-05-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Ygal Arounian","x":"I think some of the ways -- it's been depicted about how AI disrupts your business model.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2023-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"Core platform revenue was supported by 3% growth in domains on stronger customer additions from higher demand and price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2023-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"Excluding the impact of aftermarket, the drivers of growth in bookings were strong customer additions and price increases in domains as well as strong attach in applications and commerce.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2023-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"On our core platform restructuring initiative, we completed the migration of Media Temple and Main Street Hub customers to the GoDaddy technology stack.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2023-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"This is a 300-basis point increase from our 2021 rate of 23% on better operating leverage from improved marketing performance, restructuring efforts benefits from our continued move of loads to cloud and the incorporation of AI into our operating model.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2023-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"And if I could just add to that and to clarify, we -- while we look out in '24, we are reaffirming our guidance for 2023 in the range for revenue just FYI [ph].","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2023-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"Core platform revenue was supported by 4% growth in domains on stronger customer additions from higher demand and price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2023-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"Excluding the impact of aftermarket, the drivers of growth in bookings were strong customer additions and price increases in domains as well as strong attachment applications in commerce.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2023-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aman Bhutani","x":"While margin improvement is increasingly evident in our financial performance, this stems from our earlier restructuring, brand integration and diligent efforts for over a year to drive cloud adoption, which unlock additional savings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2023-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"Overall, during the third quarter, we reduced our tech and dev and capital spending by 5% from our restructuring efforts, the migration of noncore hosting assets and reduced data center capital expenditures.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2024-02-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"Growth in Core Platform during the fourth quarter was supported by domain's growth of 4%, a continued strong demand and price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2023 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2024-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"With that, during the fourth quarter, we reduced our combined technology and development and capital spending by 7% from our migrations, divestitures and restructuring efforts throughout 2023, as well as from reduced data center capital expenditures.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2024 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2024-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sang-Jin Byun","x":"You pushed through the price increases on productivity and now on payments.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2024 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2024-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sang-Jin Byun","x":"I'm just wondering how much pricing power is left, especially given it seems a lot of SMBs is still somewhat struggling.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2024 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2024-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Aman Bhutani","x":"We are also investing more in GABI, our internal AI-powered guide assist bot, which can now communicate in over 60 languages.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2024 Q2","e":"gddy","d":"2024-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jian Li","x":"So the EBITDA margin beat this quarter, but you're maintaining the full year guide.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2024 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2024-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Aman Bhutani","x":"It is a compelling proof point to our multiple year journey to successfully leverage our software platform and unleash the combined power of our infrastructure, large-scale data, experimentation, AI and machine learning capabilities.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2024 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"This was driven by the gross margin tailwind noted above, coupled with operational discipline that drove leverage in our P&L. The front-loaded benefits of our 2023 restructuring, infrastructure simplification and global talent recruitment are evident, and we are pleased with these accomplishments.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2024 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"We had seen some front-loaded benefits from some of the restructuring simplification efforts we had, global recruitment we talked about hit into Q3.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2024 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2025-02-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Aman Bhutani","x":"And then on the question on internal efficiencies, you know, where obviously, I'm super excited about AI and we continue to invest in AI, machine learning, generative AI, and now agentic AI as well.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2024 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2025-02-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Aman Bhutani","x":"And in terms of AI and infrastructure cost, and discussions internally on infrastructure, you know, this is a quickly evolving situation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2025 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"I want to take a moment to acknowledge that the broader macroeconomic environment, including tariffs, is top of mind.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2025 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"To be clear, for GoDaddy, our direct exposure to tariffs is not material.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2025 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2025-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Coolbrith","x":"I think that they, they rolled out some price increases in February for consumers, but now it sounds like, there was one also for commercial products in April.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2025 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2025-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Aman Bhutani","x":"So the sort of price increases on their side don't directly impact us.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2025 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2025-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"So feeling good about it, why we're reaffirming the guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"GDDY 2025 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Amanpal Bhutani","x":"And even as we look to invest in AI or the AI products, as we talked today, we have a couple of exciting product launches powered by AI, all of those sort of followed 2 core things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/godaddy-gddy-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GDDY 2025 Q4","e":"gddy","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Arjun Bhatia","x":"So I'm curious, just as you looked at your old funnel, was there anything that sort of was indicating that the competitive intensity was increasing, especially from some of the Vibe coding players out there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/godaddy-gddy-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GDDY 2026 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"Our expanded margin reflects the efficiency of our model and gives us the flexibility to invest in our AI transformation while maintaining a strong balance sheet and a durable free cash flow profile.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/godaddy-gddy-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GDDY 2026 Q1","e":"gddy","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"This reflects our ability to drive continued operational leverage and AI-driven productivity gains while increasing our investments in our AI-native products, marketing, and compute costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/godaddy-gddy-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GDDY 2026 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark McCaffrey","x":"We are reaffirming our normalized EBITDA margin target of over 33% for the year, reflecting more than 100 basis points of expansion on continued operating leverage and AI-driven productivity alongside continued investment in AI products, platform, marketing and compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/godaddy-gddy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GDDY 2026 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Amanpal Bhutani","x":"When we look at the use of AI internally and our OpEx spend, it comes back to some of the things that we talked about for Airo as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/godaddy-gddy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GDDY 2026 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Elizabeth Elliott","x":"And I believe we have a Verisign price increase coming soon.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/godaddy-gddy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GDDY 2026 Q3","e":"gddy","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Elizabeth Elliott","x":"How are you thinking about working through the latest Verisign price increase?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/godaddy-gddy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[41,1,6120,0,0,0,4676,1050],[42,1,6842,0,0,0,5117,1452],[43,1,7760,0,0,0,7590,0],[44,1,8557,0,0,0,8138,280],[45,1,9546,0,0,0,9036,290],[46,1,6025,0,0,0,5895,0],[47,1,7244,0,0,0,7094,0],[48,1,7933,0,0,0,7775,0],[49,1,6756,0,0,0,6616,0],[50,1,6534,0,0,0,6392,0],[51,1,7958,0,0,0,7605,207],[52,1,8406,0,0,0,8151,101],[53,1,7981,0,0,0,7749,72],[54,1,8904,0,0,0,8445,311],[55,1,8384,0,0,0,7982,234],[56,1,9230,0,0,0,8933,105],[57,1,4800,0,0,0,4626,0],[58,1,7592,0,0,0,7404,0],[59,1,9223,0,0,0,8573,436],[60,1,9569,0,0,0,9331,0],[61,1,8885,0,0,0,8485,220],[64,1,8648,0,0,0,8511